    "body": "> I know, and I don't think there should be a difference between no sanitizer and a no-op sanitizer.\n\nI don't see the reasoning but I don't have strong opinions one way or the other.\n\nOne thing we can do is make everything use the inert creation time document and for now put a note that createContextualFragment behaves differently in implementations or have a special step for it that loads images, like it does with scripts today.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
