    "created_at": "2026-01-08T13:58:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-08T13:58:40Z",
    "body": "After researching this further, I think the current behavior is spec-compliant, because https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#relevant-mutations says also that an image should be loaded when adopted.\n\nThat means that even if the image is created in the inert document, it will be loaded when adopted into the contextual fragment.",
